{"4016760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Balkan Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 4016760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an entrepreneur and build your very own store in the heart of the Balkans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a small neighborhood shop and gradually turn it into a large retail chain. Stock the shelves, manage your inventory, serve customers, and keep an eye on your budget. Balance demand, pricing, and expenses to grow a successful business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras/409aab78dcc4a31cd652e0a1ffa596d2.avif?t=1779945964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras_big/409aab78dcc4a31cd652e0a1ffa596d2.avif?t=1779945964 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIEVES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one guarantees the safety of your store, and nothing stops it from being completely looted. Thieves are clever individuals who know how to rob your shop in the best possible way. They may come in groups or act alone in search of better loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras/eb1690e33667ad8a0c63520b12daa0c7.avif?t=1779945964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras_big/eb1690e33667ad8a0c63520b12daa0c7.avif?t=1779945964 width=1560 height=194 /></span>A team of cleaners, stockers, cashiers, and many more will support you in developing your perfect store—and perhaps even take over the entire workload. But beware: there’s no guarantee they won’t quit at any moment if they get tired of you and your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras/b65189433c52ea1816259d6e73847a8c.avif?t=1779945964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras_big/b65189433c52ea1816259d6e73847a8c.avif?t=1779945964 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE THAN ONE STORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our city, once your first store is fully developed, you can take on a second one for even greater success and profit.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an entrepreneur and build your very own store in the heart of the Balkans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a small neighborhood shop and gradually turn it into a large retail chain. Stock the shelves, manage your inventory, serve customers, and keep an eye on your budget. Balance demand, pricing, and expenses to grow a successful business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras/409aab78dcc4a31cd652e0a1ffa596d2.avif?t=1779945964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras_big/409aab78dcc4a31cd652e0a1ffa596d2.avif?t=1779945964 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIEVES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one guarantees the safety of your store, and nothing stops it from being completely looted. Thieves are clever individuals who know how to rob your shop in the best possible way. They may come in groups or act alone in search of better loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras/eb1690e33667ad8a0c63520b12daa0c7.avif?t=1779945964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras_big/eb1690e33667ad8a0c63520b12daa0c7.avif?t=1779945964 width=1560 height=194 /></span>A team of cleaners, stockers, cashiers, and many more will support you in developing your perfect store—and perhaps even take over the entire workload. But beware: there’s no guarantee they won’t quit at any moment if they get tired of you and your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras/b65189433c52ea1816259d6e73847a8c.avif?t=1779945964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/extras_big/b65189433c52ea1816259d6e73847a8c.avif?t=1779945964 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE THAN ONE STORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our city, once your first store is fully developed, you can take on a second one for even greater success and profit.</p>", "short_description": "“Balkan Shop Simulator” lets you manage your own store in the Balkans – stock shelves, serve customers, and grow your businesses. From a small local shop to a thriving retail chain, success depends on your skills!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/5bda66e62a2e9ecb03f1e3d10490f5b10c80f3f3/header.jpg?t=1779945964", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/a571ea885129c058bd10820f1d3c8b917c2d0318/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779945964", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016760/a571ea885129c058bd10820f1d3c8b917c2d0318/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17799